ss=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-302804 apple.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ac/Spine_static-302804_apple.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"283\" height=\"386\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"283\" data-file-height=\"386\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3028\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/APPLe\" title=\"APPLe\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/APPLe\" title=\"APPLe\"><img alt=\"APPLe\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302801.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/59/HeadIconSmall-302801.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/APPLe\" title=\"APPLe\">APPLe</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>S01</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>鹰与众神的时代</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：302804</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">一颗苹果能拥有多大的能力？<br />在传说中，它是一枚挂在树梢的果实，为人类带来智慧。而在另一个传说中，它是最为人所知的伊甸碎片，能够制造幻象、控制人类的思想。它容纳了先贤们的知识，为后来者提供某种更为广阔的可能性——有人利用这些知识，制造出了堪称毁灭的灾难。<br />“当然，”APPLe先生总结道，“APPLe某认为，这些传说仅仅是人们休闲时的谈资。现实生活中的苹果当然不具备杀伤力，它的美德是多汁与博学，仅此而已。”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302804\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302807.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/21/Belonging-302807.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">洞察者<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Seer</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />1.2<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一枚优质水晶石透镜。视野明亮，亦即心灵明亮，对一位哲人，尤其是一颗扎入古希腊哲思海洋的苹果而言，它必不可少。<br />同时，在畅饮葡萄酒后，清晰的视野也许能减少些许眩晕。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302808.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/92/Belonging-302808.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“别具一格的色彩”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Color All Its Own\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>独特的水果彩绘，古典时代的见证者，文艺复兴天才们的灵感之源，随便你如何称呼。<br />变成这副模样，完全是一种命运的意外，受访者完全理解人们对苹果的追求，尽管被追求的实际上是另一颗著名果实。喜剧和悲剧是一片苹果叶的两面，受访者如此评价。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302809.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/8/8f/Belonging-302809.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“哲人的宾客”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Guest of the Philosopher\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />5.8<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一条精美绶带，辉煌闪亮，如同学者们脑中的金色火花。<br />受访者在雅典的某间房舍中获得了它。据受访者回忆，在那场聚会上，朗诵、辩论、戏剧表演和美酒全都足量供应……直至受访者在柔软的布帛间醒来，昏昏沉沉，发现自己获得了雅典学者的精美礼物与不朽友谊。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B41.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 智慧尽头1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B41.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B41.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B41.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B41.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B41.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B41.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B42.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 智慧尽头2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B42.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B42.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B42.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B42.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B42.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%99%BA%E6%85%A7%E5%B0%BD%E5%A4%B42.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">智慧尽头 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Fruit of Wisdom</small></span></span>"}}